Package: gamfluence
Type: Package
Title: Deletion Influence Diagnostics for 'mgcv' Additive Models
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Ziqi", "Song", email = "ziqisong030@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: For penalised additive (mixed) models fitted with gam() from
    'mgcv', each site (cluster) is deleted in turn and the model is refitted
    twice, reusing the full-data model matrix and penalties: once with the
    estimated smoothing parameters (and negative binomial theta) held fixed,
    and once with them re-estimated by restricted maximum likelihood (REML).
    Comparing the changes in the other sites' fitted values shows how much of
    a site's influence appears only when the smoothing parameters re-tune.
    Includes a plot method and a dataset of coral trout counts on the Great
    Barrier Reef.
